"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173620/extras/2e05b84c13ebbe9094a9a15b71ba3228.poster.avif?t=1781897921\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173620/extras/2e05b84c13ebbe9094a9a15b71ba3228.webm?t=1781897921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173620/extras/2e05b84c13ebbe9094a9a15b71ba3228.mp4?t=1781897921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR OPERATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your kitchen, hidden workstations, and equipment. Larger setups allow faster production, riskier jobs, and higher payouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173620/extras/f0cf22d54a1cb98d0dd79b35067fa4e0.poster.avif?t=1781897921\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173620/extras/f0cf22d54a1cb98d0dd79b35067fa4e0.webm?t=1781897921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173620/extras/f0cf22d54a1cb98d0dd79b35067fa4e0.mp4?t=1781897921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEAL WITH WEIRD NPCs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with dozens of hand-crafted NPCs, each with their own stories, personalities, and ongoing problems that unfold over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173620/extras/449a237786747465708148eca5ed2adc.poster.avif?t=1781897921\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173620/extras/449a237786747465708148eca5ed2adc.webm?t=1781897921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173620/extras/449a237786747465708148eca5ed2adc.mp4?t=1781897921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or team up with up to four players online. Split tasks, run both sides of the business together, and deal with the chaos as a group.</p>", "short_description": "Run your pizza shop up front and handle shady business out back. Help hand-crafted NPCs with favors that never go as planned. Play solo or online co-op with up to four players and expand your operation across Hobarey Town. In this darkly comedic management sim - become that guy everyone knows.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173620/ebebf52f4ae57acd8593d92b48d0adec0f3c3992/header.jpg?t=1781897921", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173620/2d86413a1135b5fd0e027d027ff569c8fc628101/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781897921", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173620/2d86413a1135b5fd0e027d027ff569c8fc628101/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781897921", "website": "https://www.bunchofnerds.studio/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1600 or Intel Core i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon RX580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> -</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recomm